  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "Variation of Condition 1 (Approved Plans) of planning permission 25/AP/3412 dated 16/01/2026 for Replacement of two existing refrigeration packs in the stores service yard with one refrigeration pack and a five-fan gas cooler\r\rProposed variation:\rThe location of both the gas cooler and refrigeration pack are swapping locations. The refrigeration pack has been replaced from a reach in pack to a walk in pack resulting in an increase in size of 1160mm overall length. The gas cooler size remains the same. \rReason for changing the reach in pack to a house pack is due to ensure this can be maintained safely by Maintenance engineers as all components are covered and protected from the external elements.  The reason for the swapping of locations between the gas cooler and the refrigeration pack is due to the required pipe runs which will connect to the pack and then the gas cooler to facilitate installation.",
